E AX3027 505-decl-macro-positions.ax:14:2-7 declaration-macro "macro `exprM` has an expression template and cannot stand in declaration position" !"an expression macro's template is one expression; a declaration position needs declarations (macro-system.md MAC-CAP-8)" ?"give it a rule form - `(macro name ((name args ...) (fn ...) ...))` - whose template is declarations"
E AX3027 505-decl-macro-positions.ax:16:2-7 declaration-macro "a generated declaration's name must be a bare identifier; `nm` was given an expression" !"the parameter stands in a NAME position of the template - a declaration head or a parameter list - and only an identifier can be a name" ?"pass a plain name in this argument position" &505-decl-macro-positions.ax:12:8-13:"declM"
E AX3027 505-decl-macro-positions.ax:20:13-18 declaration-macro "declaration macro `declM` invoked in expression position" !"the two template kinds are disjoint: an expression position needs a value, and this macro generates declarations (macro-system.md MAC-CAP-8)" ?"a rule-form macro's template is declarations; invoke it at top level"
